{"steam_appid":2882870,"steam_name":"Doll Impostor","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2882870/925551300/0c5723675aa4e4327f2f5da4ca6dabf6a4215cfd/1776717793/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1776726151","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257323066/2e14ff7463d1c103917ec4da12d49eac72bc5ff3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1776726151","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/58cdbf21c113b364fdc8b4bb4a82f33c9ac640db/ss_58cdbf21c113b364fdc8b4bb4a82f33c9ac640db.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781123706","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/40c0691451ed3862cef6056c2e5943585e548988/ss_40c0691451ed3862cef6056c2e5943585e548988.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781123706","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/e50f2fa615d1451408b6b9fce4f20d4236a477e5/ss_e50f2fa615d1451408b6b9fce4f20d4236a477e5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781123706","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/cd944429ff6829f7370319a00788497524016ca6/ss_cd944429ff6829f7370319a00788497524016ca6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781123706","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/be56e5c7e9a18be116bdf96bbc6168e37cae4e71/ss_be56e5c7e9a18be116bdf96bbc6168e37cae4e71.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781123706"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attention: This game contains Jumpscares! (can disable it)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/d75e623a44cb320ed7edcddb14ce8c6e.webp?t=1781123706\" width=616 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/0df18840993ff24bceb1447a3b014b9b.poster.avif?t=1781123706\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/0df18840993ff24bceb1447a3b014b9b.webm?t=1781123706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/0df18840993ff24bceb1447a3b014b9b.mp4?t=1781123706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is to find the impostor doll, which will play with you to avoid being caught. Perform the following steps:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues and evidence that the impostor leaves behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study and analyze their movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discard candidates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the impostor before 9 AM</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/afeb77a0ef4c31e7dd5f30f661ddb0aa.webp?t=1781123706\" width=616 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/e6621cb6a5d8fec39f90c433641c0990.avif?t=1781123706\" width=616 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/f8cf6feadd12be26da05169042658929.avif?t=1781123706\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dolls have their own objectives, preferences, friendships, enmities, loves, and hatreds towards circumstances, events, or other dolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/fa9f3a8a34c02f1c333d1ba72432a989.webp?t=1781123706\" width=616 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/8a8180aee15299bbabbff2cda709d85c.poster.avif?t=1781123706\" width=616 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/8a8180aee15299bbabbff2cda709d85c.webm?t=1781123706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/8a8180aee15299bbabbff2cda709d85c.mp4?t=1781123706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps will help you catch conservative dolls; perhaps tempting them by turning on music or a television will make them react, allowing you to better interpret their tastes and appreciations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/c54826da37051c747f271983f838e508.webp?t=1781123706\" width=616 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/1e0f536166720d2525c5d47861c31058.poster.avif?t=1781123706\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/1e0f536166720d2525c5d47861c31058.webm?t=1781123706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/1e0f536166720d2525c5d47861c31058.mp4?t=1781123706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not trust their actions; these dolls are much smarter than you think. They are capable of moving others from their place and annihilating other dolls in order to confuse you, especially if you do not know each doll well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might assume that everything is over if you find a single doll out of its box. However, it may not have moved on its own; another doll might have moved it, or even moved many others while it remains completely still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/a931cbb7b6e9d320b8454a92c17c17fb.webp?t=1781123706\" width=616 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/795663e2c124e23c3be11435e20b1f4a.poster.avif?t=1781123706\" width=616 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/795663e2c124e23c3be11435e20b1f4a.webm?t=1781123706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882870/extras/795663e2c124e23c3be11435e20b1f4a.mp4?t=1781123706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's extremely important that you keep the door closed; failing to do so could have catastrophic consequences, from letting the impostor escape to altering the order of your eliminations, or even preventing you from making it through the night.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 Bits)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD FX-8320<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> MSI Radeon R7 200 Series<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 18 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3s</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bits)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 18 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR, SteamVR, Meta Quest 3s</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["David Gallardo"],"publishers":["HeadArrow"],"release_date":"28 Mar, 2024"}